 Research Institute in Tandil, Argentina, and also an Assistant Professor at 
&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.unicen.edu.ar&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;UNICEN&lt;/a&gt;
.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My main research interests include social computing applications of machine learning and recommender systems.&lt;/p&gt;
